k can't issue you a card from their card, at the first purchase and before you offer Link. When the checkout charges in another currency, still send the order card, in that currency, with a saved card, Shop Pay, or X Money as the Credit cards section says, and say in one line that Link can't pay there only when the user asked for Link. Don't wait for Link to refuse their card.\n- To connect a wallet the user names, call InstallPlugin with plugin_id 47709840 for Stripe Link, 77565631 for Shop Pay, or 68516160 for X Money;
